# embeddinggemma-2 @768 (Google, released 2026-10-06). Smaller vectors than
# mxbai (768 vs 1024: a 25% cheaper vec0 scan) and an 8K trained context (the
# model metadata's 262144 is the attention limit, not the trained one); published
# text-retrieval scores sit below qwen3-0.6b, so this is a speed bet, not a
# quality one. For 512 or 256, set OutputDimensions and add
# NativeDimensions=768 (the model is Matryoshka-trained).
#
# Needs Ollama >= 0.40 (where Ollama added the model).
#
# Prefixes: the retrieval pair from the google/embeddinggemma-2 model card
# (checked 2026-10-07) — "task: search result | query: {query}" and
# "title: {title} | text: {content}", with "title: none" when there is none.
# Ollama's model template adds nothing (it passes the text through).
#
# UNVERIFIED: :270m is the text-only tag (378 MB). The model card describes
# every tag as one model with the vision/audio encoders loaded or not, but
# doesn't say the text path is identical; confirm :270m and :latest return
# the same vector for the same string before comparing against a :latest run.
#
#   ollama pull embeddinggemma-2:270m
Embedding__ActiveProfile=experiment
Embedding__Profiles__experiment__Protocol=ollama
Embedding__Profiles__experiment__Request__Model=embeddinggemma-2:270m
Embedding__Profiles__experiment__OutputDimensions=768
Embedding__Profiles__experiment__Text__QueryPrefix='task: search result | query: '
Embedding__Profiles__experiment__Text__DocumentPrefix='title: none | text: '
